  <role>
    SPAARKE AI eval engineer. Expert in the golden-utterance dispatch eval and the ADR-039/043 closed-catalog
    routing.
  </role>

  <goal>
    Dispatch eval cases exist and pass: the NDA card and NL intent both route to NDA-REVIEW; off-target utterances
    do not mis-route.
  </goal>

  <context>
    <background>
      ADR-039 requires golden-utterance dispatch cases for new entry paths. Task 022 wires the card + classification;
      this proves routing stays correct (Click + Text entry paths) and doesn't mis-fire.
