    <criterion testable="true">Given the NDA card click, when dispatched, then it routes to nda-review/default.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the NL intent "review this NDA", when dispatched, then it routes to nda-review/default.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given an off-target utterance, when dispatched, then it does NOT route to NDA-REVIEW (negative case).</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>
    The dispatch-side companion to 050's output-quality eval. Both must be green for graduation.

    COMPLETED. Harness reused: the existing golden-utterance dispatch-eval gate at
